    narr:narration """The thematic focus centers on [core feature definition](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) as the product's primary differentiator by capturing decision artifacts precisely at consensus. Operational reports [detail ship metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1788082257117_1) alongside [sprint velocity tracking](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1788082257117_2), while recognizing [technical enablers](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1788082257117_3) as key unlocks for delivery. The trajectory examines [sprint delivery enablers](narr:Position_SprintDeliveryEnablers) to understand the drivers behind velocity and async widget deployment.""" ;
